    - target: {fileID: 6443777387910735989, guid: 10648b19612872c4f85593b236504a00,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "Medical Examination Record:\r\n\r\nAssessment Time: 08:40\r\n\r\n1.
        Vital Signs:\r\n- Heart rate: approximately 72 bpm, regular rhythm\r\n- Respiratory
        rate: approximately 14 breaths per minute, stable\r\n- Body temperature:
        36.7\xB0C\r\n- Blood pressure: 118/76 mmHg\r\n\r\n2. External Examination:\r\n-
        No visible signs of external injury, bruising, or laceration\r\n- Normal
        range of motion in all joints\r\n- No defensive wounds observed on hands
        or forearms\r\n\r\n3. Neurological and Cognitive Response:\r\n- Pupils respond
        normally to light\r\n- No apparent disorientation or delayed response\r\n-
        Coordination appears normal\r\n\r\n4. Chemical and Toxicology Screening:\r\n-
        No detectable presence of common sedatives or anesthetics\r\n- No abnormal
        chemical substances found in blood samples\r\n\r\n5. Additional Observations:\r\n-
        Clothing appears intact and undamaged\r\n- No foreign residues observed on
        the body\r\n- Minor fluctuations in certain physiological indicators are
        noted but remain within normal range\r\n\r\nOverall Observation:\r\n- No
        significant abnormalities detected across all examinations\r\n- Current condition
        is consistent with normal daily activity"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
